# IMITATION-FIRST: the held-out measurement with goals 5-200 m away instead of
# 5-25 m (user 2026-11-04: "can we increase 5-200m?"). il_eval.env with ONLY
# the goal band widened, so the result reads straight against the 5-25 m one.
# This trainer's goal sampler (carla_core.reset_hero) reads GOAL_DIST_MIN/MAX at
# every reset; nothing else caps it here (the GOAL_DIST_START/TARGET curriculum
# that pinned v44 belongs to the TQC arm). The 1000-step goal clock allows ~400 m
# at the clone's ~14 km/h, room for a 200 m goal plus detours.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_eval.env"
export GOAL_DIST_MIN=5 GOAL_DIST_MAX=200
